<title>SPAIN: Spain's MEFF exchanges down for technical reasons.</title>
<headline>Spain's MEFF exchanges down for technical reasons.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's financial derivative exchanges MEFF Renta Fija and Variable delayed their opening on Thursday for technical reasons, sources at the two said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market has been suspended for the time being for technical difficulties and there is no specific time foreseen to reinstate it,&quot; the Barcelona fixed-income exchange said.</p>
<p>The Madrid based stock derivatives exchange said the situation was the same.</p>
<p>&quot;There are technical problems that have delayed the opening and we still don't know when they will be resolved,&quot; a source there said.   --Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
